  "no_result": true,
  "gate_should_answer": false,
  "pre_gate_answer": "# Markdown Briefing: Minimum Experience Requirements\n\n## Supported by the Provided Evidence\n\n- **SBCERS 2020 PE RFP**\n  - **Minimum requirement:** **10 years**\n  - **Applies to:** **At least one key professional** assigned to the SBCERS account\n  - **Additional condition:** **3 of those years must be with the current firm**\n  - **Relevant experience:** Recommending investments in **private equity investment programs for institutional clients**\n\n- **Missouri LAGERS private-markets RFP**\n  - **Minimum requirement:** **5 years**\n  - **Applies to:** **Lead consultant** assigned to the account\n  - **Relevant experience:** Serving in a **lead role** recommending **private market investments** across investment verticals to **U.S. public pension funds**\n\n- **Illinois FY25 evidence provided**\n  - The supplied evidence does **not clearly identify TRS Illinois FY25 PE RFP**.\n  - Instead, it refers to **Firefighters’ Pension Investment Fund (FPIF)** private markets consulting/advisory services.\n  - **Minimum requirement shown:** **10 years of industry experience**\n  - **Applies to:** **Lead consultant, CIO, or other senior staff member** assigned to the account\n\n## Not Supported by the Provided Evidence\n\nThe supplied material does **not** provide enough evidence to determine the minimum-experience requirement for:\n\n- **Hawaii ERS 2017 PE RFP notice**\n- **Hawaii ERS 2022 PE RFP**\n- **Baltimore BCERS alternatives RFP**\n- **TRS Illinois FY25 PE RFP** as specifically named\n\n## Bottom Line\n\n- **SBCERS 2020:** **10 years** minimum, plus **3 years with current firm**\n- **Missouri LAGERS:** **5 years** minimum\n- **Illinois evidence provided (FPIF, not clearly TRS Illinois):** **10 years**\n- **Hawaii ERS 2017, Hawaii ERS 2022, Baltimore BCERS, and clearly identified TRS Illinois FY25:** **Not determinable from the supplied evidence**",
